      Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bb66605723840af4095c1cd31b791acd, type: 3}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Sure I do, although you might be exaggerating...
    RelationshipCheckRequired: 0
    RelationshipRange: {x: 0, y: 0}
    BranchingDialogueHigh: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9202b01490dd39b49a15cae653236734, type: 2}
